{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","冰冻之墓"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","氷結の墓"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标造成伤害和冻结，并制造极寒领域施加霜冻。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵にダメージを与えて氷結を付与。さらにフリーズゾーンを生成し、凍傷を付与"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","短暂蓄力后，选择一名敌人，对其造成240% + 20% ATK伤害，并冻结目标6秒。并在目标及其周围2格范围内制造极寒领域，领域内的敌人每2秒会被施加一次“霜冻”状态。优先选择周围2格敌人数量最多的敌人作为目标。每层“霜冻”会使其降低15急速，持续6秒，至多叠加3层。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","力を溜めてから、敵1体に240% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、6秒間の氷結を付与。対象とその周囲2マス内にフリーズゾーンを発生させ、ゾーン内の敵に2秒ごとに「凍傷」を1スタック付与。周囲2マス内に最も多くの敵がいるマスを優先的に対象に選択。「凍傷」1スタックにつき、6秒間、対象の速度-15。「凍傷」は最大3スタックまで重複可能"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"keyword:freeze"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":39,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"keyword:freeze"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが260% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","冻结时间延长至8秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","氷結の持続時間が8秒にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n